@page "/"

<PageTitle>Arcade Hub</PageTitle>

<div class="container mt-4">
    <h1 class="display-4 text-center">Welcome to the Arcade Hub</h1>
    <hr class="mb-3" />

    <div class="row align-items-start justify-content-between g-4 mt-0">
        <div class="col-lg-7 d-flex flex-column justify-content-start text-center">
            <h3 class="mb-3">Select a Game</h3>

            <div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-center gap-3">
                <a href="/tictactoe" class="btn btn-primary btn-xl px-5 py-3">Tic-Tac-Toe</a>
                <a href="/snake" class="btn btn-success btn-xl px-5 py-3">Snake</a>
                <a href="/pacman" class="btn btn-warning btn-xl px-5 py-3 text-dark">Pacman</a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="col-lg-5 ms-auto d-flex">
            <div class="text-start bg-light p-4 rounded shadow-sm border w-100 align-self-stretch">
                <h2 class="h4">About This Project</h2>
                <p class="mb-3">
                    This project is a collection of classic arcade games implemented using Blazor Web App.
                    It includes a collection of popular games that is only growing in size.
                </p>
                <p class="mb-0">
                    Built using C# and the Blazor Web App framework. It is meant to be an assembly of 3 previous projects
                    I made in the past, along with more small ones yet to come, with improvements and optimizations,
                    all gathered in one place. This home page serves as a central hub for users to access each game
                    from the left-side menu and also provides a brief overview of the project.
                </p>
            </div>
        </aside>
    </div>
</div>